Z||000000||Joe Torma||12-15-2001||12:05 AM||||Ok, in an attempt to inspire some ideas and pretty much find out what you guys/girls want,  reply with what you'd like to have.<P>Now, there are some natural combinations of colors...<BR>--WHITE guage faces illuminate BLUE/GREEN.<BR>--EL Yellow is Yellow when off<BR>--EL White is Pink when off<BR>--EL Purple is Red when off<P>But, with the white, I most likely can make any color illumination you want so pick a color.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Also add if you would like additional graphics...pegasus, "Fiero", MinnGreen's Checkerboard design<P>Thanks!<BR>---------------------------------------<P>FACE GLOW GUAGES:<BR>Choose from above EL colors or Single color<BR>--FACE illumination:<BR>--NUMBER COLOR:<P><BR>NUMBER GLOW ONLY:<BR>--FACE Color:<BR>--Number Illumination:<P>------------------<BR>Its never going to be finished...<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig2_2.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 12-15-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||California Kid||12-15-2001||12:18 AM||||Bright Yellow when off, 185mph speedo with crystal, 6,000 start of redline on tach. same theme other gauges (no GT oil or volt).<BR>Crossed racing flags on Tach and Speedo (ie matching design). Open to lighting/luminations of gauges, would like to see some pics that would work with '88 instrument setup.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/californiakidsig_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
